    <Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_MARX_INSTITUTE_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>共产党的特色区域，替代学院。学院的相邻加成科技值同时提供等额信仰和生产力。保留大科学家点数，每回合额外提供1大预言家点数和1大工程师点数。每相邻一个工业区，额外获得2科技相邻加成，同时提供等额信仰和生产力。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_MARX_INSTITUTE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>A unique district of the Communist Party, replacing the Campus. Its Science adjacency bonus also grants equal Faith and Production. Retains Great Scientist points and additionally provides +1 Great Prophet point and +1 Great Engineer point per turn.Each adjacent Industrial Zone grants an additional +2 Science adjacency bonus, mirrored as Faith and Production.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_MARX_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE_ADJACENCY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>+{1_num} 科技来自相邻工业区。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_MARX_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE_ADJACENCY" Language="en_US">
      <Text>+{1_num} Science from adjacent Industrial Zones.</Text>
